# TOPIC

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:kino, "~> 0.14"},
  {:nimble_csv, "~> 1.2"}
])
```

## Live data

`q(db, sql)` runs `board-ro sql` from the notebook folder, so it reads only the
databases of this board, in a read-only transaction. The notebook holds no password.

```elixir
defmodule Live do
  NimbleCSV.define(CSV, separator: ",", escape: "\"")

  def q(db, sql) do
    case System.cmd("board-ro", ["sql", db, sql], cd: __DIR__, stderr_to_stdout: true) do
      {out, 0} ->
        [header | rows] = CSV.parse_string(out, skip_headers: false)
        keys = Enum.map(header, &String.to_atom/1)
        rows |> Enum.map(&Map.new(Enum.zip(keys, &1))) |> Kino.DataTable.new()

      {out, code} ->
        raise "board-ro exit #{code}: #{out}"
    end
  end
end

import Live
```

## Queries

```elixir
q("db1", "select 1 as one")
```

